  <ProfessionalSummary>覆盖主机冷却水系统监测仪表安装、集控室远程显示报警及流量温度报警设定要求。</ProfessionalSummary>
  <EngineeringRequirements count="3">
    <Requirement id="ER-P033-01" level="1" requirementType="alarm_protection">
      <sysml:Name>冷却水流量温度报警设定</sysml:Name>
      <sysml:Text>主机冷却水系统应设置冷却水流量低限报警和温度高限报警，当冷却水流量低于设定值或温度超过上限时，应在集控室触发声光报警。</sysml:Text>
      <sysml:VerifiedBy method="commissioning_check" />
      <sysml:DerivedFrom refId="ER-P033" />
      <sysml:Traceability>
        <Evidence id="E-CTRL-COOL-002" supportStatus="verified_by_direct_evidence" />
        <Evidence id="E-IACS-M3-002" supportStatus="verified_by_direct_evidence" />
        <Evidence id="E-ISO8861-002" supportStatus="verified_by_direct_evidence" />
        <Evidence id="E-CCS-COOL-001" supportStatus="verified_by_direct_evidence" />
        <Evidence id="E-SOLAS-COOL-001" supportStatus="verified_by_direct_evidence" />
      </sysml:Traceability>
      <sysml:QualityStatus>
        <SupportStatus>verified_by_direct_evidence</SupportStatus>
        <RiskIfUnmet>无法及时报警可能导致主机冷却异常损坏。</RiskIfUnmet>
      </sysml:QualityStatus>
      <sysml:AcceptanceCriteria>
        <Criterion>检查报警设定值符合主机厂家Technical Data及船级社规则要求。</Criterion>
        <Criterion>调试期间模拟流量低限和温度高限工况，确认声光报警正确触发。</Criterion>
      </sysml:AcceptanceCriteria>
      <sysml:EngineeringRationale>本条覆盖方面【冷却水流量温度报警设定】，来自原始需求「当冷却水流量低于设定值或温度超过上限时触发声光报警」。E-CTRL-COOL-002（IACS UR E10）支撑了HT冷却水出机高温报警和进机低压报警的设置要求；E-IACS-M3-002（IACS UR M3.1）支撑了温度高限报警的设定要求；E-ISO8861-002（ISO 8861:1998）支撑了流量低限和温度高限报警的要求；E-CCS-COOL-001（CCS规则）支撑了高温报警及报警值可调的要求；E-SOLAS-COOL-001（SOLAS Reg.26）支撑了温度异常时报警的要求。</sysml:EngineeringRationale>
      <sysml:QualityGateReport passed="true" score="1.0">
